comments.message:
Can we do this search operation in-line?

`for (const auto& [l_serviceName, l_interfaceLsit] :vpd::dbusUtility::getObjectMap(i_inventoryObjPath, l_availbleInf))
            {
                if (l_serviceName == vpd::constants::pimServiceName)
                {
                    // The object is already under PIM. No need to process
                    // again. Retain the old value.
                    return;
                }
            }`

  If `getObjectMap` returns empty, the `for` loop will not execute.
